OL,1,D]GYLE NEWS             TUESDAY     1/2 
OL,2,K                                       
OL,3,BFinland's unemployment rate remains    
OL,4,Babove 10%                              
OL,5,GThe latest figures reveal that one in  
OL,6,Gfour people aged 15-24 are now         
OL,7,Gunemployed.                            
OL,8,K                                       
OL,9,BWhere you live will cost you more   or 
OL,10,Bless   in municipal tax next year      
OL,11,GThe gap between the highest- and       
OL,12,Glowest-taxing municipalities is more   
OL,13,Gthan 2,400 euros a year.               
OL,14,K                                       
OL,15,BFinland seeks 'cyber soldiers' for new 
OL,16,Bconscript training programme           
OL,17,GThe training is designed to counter    
OL,18,Ginformation warfare.                   
OL,19,K                                       
